{
  "category": "Sea Lion Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon snorts body fluids from its nose, blowing balloons to smash into its foes. It’s famous for being a hard worker.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon can control water bubbles. It practices diligently so it can learn to make big bubbles.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "The balloons it inflates with its nose grow larger and larger as it practices day by day.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Popplio gets on top of its bouncy water balloons to jump higher. It’s quite the acrobatic fighter!",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It creates special bouncy balloons to send at its opponents. When the balloons pop, the sheer force of their bursting is what deals damage.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "If Popplio want to create big, powerful balloons, they must be persistent. It takes daily practice for these Pokémon to develop their skills.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
